SUMMARY:BayCare Presents: Cancer. Know Your Risk. Take Control.
LOCATION:Tampa \, FL United States
DESCRIPTION:When it comes to cancer\, what you dont know can matter\\\; Ca
 ncer screening isnt the same for everyone but the good news is\, you can l
 earn your risk and take action early. Join us as we walk you through how c
 ancer risk is identified\, who may need extra screening\, and how personal
 ized surveillance plan can impact individual outcomes. The earlier cancer 
 is found\, the betterand for some people\, that means going beyond routine
  screenings. Explore the new tools that are helping detect cancer sooner. 
 Presented by Erika Oschmann APRN Register Here (https:events.teams.microso
 ft.comevent2893095b-a3cd-47f9-bb51-315401a329a3599ceff3-02a8-45bc-baef-c48
 cb8be94c4) (Once you register the link will be sent\, please save to log i
 nto event) \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/195506
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/195506
END:VEVENT
